<title>HONG KONG: Reuters Ist ex-HK Kong Europe/Meast air cargo report.</title>
<headline>Reuters Ist ex-HK Kong Europe/Meast air cargo report.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Current average ex-Hong Kong air cargo market rates in Hong Kong dollars per kg for a 100kg shipment, with volume-to-weight of six to one.</p>
<p>		     EUROPE</p>
<p>		     Mar 25	 Jan 10</p>
<p> HK-LHR	    25.79	  24.55</p>
<p> HK-FRA	    25.10	  24.75</p>
<p>		     MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> HK-DXB	    15.90	  15.45</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airliners, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents.</p>
<p>*All prices quoted in Hong Kong dollars.</p>
<p>*The tariff represents average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
